explain why one item is in the bundle

Usage: ambit why [OPTIONS] <kind:name>

Arguments:
  <kind:name>  `skill:<name>`, `mcp:<name>`, or `hook:<name>`

Options:
      --project <dir>  project directory
      --user           act on the user-level project in ~/.ambit
      --json           machine-readable output
      --offline        use only cached catalogs
  -h, --help           Print help
